{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“形模态”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"形模态"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\int$ 将一个对象 $X$ 对应到其"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"或基本 $\\infty$-群胚. $\\int X$ 可视为 $X$ 的 “形”.</p>\n<h2>伴随三元组</h2>\n<p>我们有形模态-"},{"Local":{"url":"降模态","text":"降模态"}},{"Plain":"-"},{"Local":{"url":"升模态","text":"升模态"}},{"Plain":"的伴随三元组\n$$\r\n\\int \\dashv \\flat \\dashv \\sharp.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}